                <mxCell id="41" value="LegacyRouteEngine.java&#xa;────────────────────────────────────&#xa;• No Spring annotations — plain Java class&#xa;• Naive algorithm: visits locations in input order&#xa;• Euclidean distance (flat earth — inaccurate)&#xa;• 1,000 iteration waste loop per location pair&#xa;• Effectively O(1000n) time complexity&#xa;• Public fields — no encapsulation&#xa;• Inner classes: Location, RouteResult" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1a0505;strokeColor=#ef4444;fontColor=#fca5a5;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="40">
